    "chunk_text": ", \u00feer \u00fe\u00e6t Ah \u00f0a o\u00f0er \u00feara martira in neahtlicere gesih\u00f0e \u00e6teaude sumum hiora geferan, \u00fe\u00e6s nama w\u00e6s W\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t meere wer & for weorulde ec swylce ae\u00f0elre gebyrde; w\u00e6s he \u00e6rest from cyninges W\u00e6s he him secgende, \u00fe\u00e6t he meahte hiora lichoman in \u00f0ere stowe gemaetan, \u00fe\u00e6r he gesawe \u00d0\u00e6t ec swylce gefylled wes. \u00d0a fundan hio sona hiora lichoman & \u00e6fter gerisenre aare martira bebyrgede w\u00e6ran; & se deg Mid \u00f0a Pippin se cyning Froncna \u00feas \u00f0ing geherde & geacsade, \u00fea sende he weorod & heht Is \u00f0\u00e6t ec s\u00e6d \u00fe\u00e6tte in \u00f0ere stowe, \u00feer hio ofslegne weran, weolle an welle, sio in \u00feere illcan Sona \u00fe\u00e6m erestan tidum, \u00fees \u00f0a lareowas cuomon in Fresena lond, & Willbrod from \u00f0em Ond somod he willnade from him onfon \u00feera eadigra apastola reliquias & Cristes martira, \u00fe\u00e6t Swylce ec monige o\u00f0re intingan he sohte & willnade o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00feer leornian o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00feanon onfon. In \u00f0em eallum mid \u00f0y he willfegen wes gefremed, he eft hwearf to codcundre laare. \u00de\u00e6re tiide \u00fea bro\u00f0or, \u00f0a \u00f0e in Fresum weran mid hine in \u00f0ere \u00feegnunge \u00f0es Godes wordes, Sendon hine \u00fea to Breotene & for hiora bene se aarwyr\u00f0a bisscop Willfer\u00f0 hine gehalgade, se Wes Theodor bisscop for\u00f0fered, & Berhwald his efterf",
